@model QuanLyKhoaHoc_UNETI4_DHTI17A3HN.ViewModels.TaiKhoanEditViewModel
@using static QuanLyKhoaHoc_UNETI4_DHTI17A3HN.Models.HangSo

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Sửa tài khoản";
}

<h2>Sửa tài khoản</h2>
<hr />

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <form asp-action="Edit" asp-route-id="@Model.MaTaiKhoan" method="post">
            <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="text-danger"></div>
            <input type="hidden" asp-for="MaTaiKhoan" />

            <div class="mb-3">
                <label asp-for="TenDangNhap" class="form-label"></label>
                <input asp-for="TenDangNhap" class="form-control" readonly />
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label asp-for="HoTen" class="form-label"></label>
                <input asp-for="HoTen" class="form-control" />
                <span asp-validation-for="HoTen" class="text-danger"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label asp-for="Email" class="form-label"></label>
                <input asp-for="Email" class="form-control" />
                <span asp-validation-for="Email" class="text-danger"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label asp-for="VaiTro" class="form-label"></label>
                <select asp-for="VaiTro" asp-items="(SelectList)ViewBag.DanhSachVaiTro" class="form-select"></select>
                <span asp-validation-for="VaiTro" class="text-danger"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="hocVienFields">
                <p class="text-muted">Cần nhập khi chuyển tài khoản sang vai trò học viên.</p>
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label asp-for="NgaySinhHocVien" class="form-label"></label>
                    <input asp-for="NgaySinhHocVien" class="form-control" />
                    <span asp-validation-for="NgaySinhHocVien" class="text-danger"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label asp-for="GioiTinhHocVien" class="form-label"></label>
                    <select asp-for="GioiTinhHocVien" class="form-select">
                        <option value="">-- Chọn giới tính --</option>
                        <option value="Nam">Nam</option>
                        <option value="Nữ">Nữ</option>
                        <option value="Khác">Khác</option>
                    </select>
                    <span asp-validation-for="GioiTinhHocVien" class="text-danger"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label asp-for="MatKhauMoi" class="form-label"></label>
                <input asp-for="MatKhauMoi" class="form-control" />
                <span asp-validation-for="MatKhauMoi" class="text-danger"></span>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Cập nhật</button>
            <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-secondary">Quay lại</a>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <partial name="_ValidationScriptsPartial" />
    <script>
        const roleSelect = document.getElementById("VaiTro");
        const studentFields = document.getElementById("hocVienFields");
        const updateStudentFields = () => {
            studentFields.hidden = roleSelect.value !== "@VaiTroTaiKhoan.HocVien";
        };
        roleSelect.addEventListener("change", updateStudentFields);
        updateStudentFields();
    </script>
}